From: basalt-ink-experiments <noreply@localhost>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 01:19:07 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 1/4] inkling2: the card spare and the elastic keep from the
 environment (BASALT_INK_*_MIB)

BASALT_INK_CARD_SPARE_MIB (1024), BASALT_INK_ELASTIC_KEEP_MIB (512), BASALT_INK_SESSION_FIXED_MIB (768) and
BASALT_INK_SPILL_MARGIN_MIB (128) override the reserves of the context plan and of the elastic spill, so a run can
try using more of the card's free memory during decode. Unset: the same values as before. A start line names the
values when any is set.

Experimental, local work branch.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>
